---
title: Not this, but that
brief: Strikes out what people assume, then reveals what is true.
notes: Replace with what you will say.
score:
  steps:
    - name: strike the assumptions
      cues:
        - use: strike
          on: .wrong
          stagger: 240
    - name: what is true
      cues:
        - use: appear
          on: truth
---
